      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "These bugs are always replicated everyday in the particular world instance at the particular time.\n\nUsing custom setting in Safety system and all avatar brocked\nThe number of instance persons: 30\nVRChat version: 2019.2.4 Build 801\nOS: Windows 10 Home 1809 (17763.557)\nCPU: Intel Core i7-7700 3.60 GHz\nGPU: GeForce GTX 1080\nGraphic driver: GeForce Game Ready Driver 430.86\n3D settings: [Power management mode] Prefer maximum performance, [Texture filtering - Quality] High performance\nVR: HTC VIVE Consumer Edition\nSteamVR version: 1.5.12",
      "viewerReactions": null
