      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd just like to say that it's appalling how this still hasn't been fixed or improved upon after effectively TWO MONTHS now. Hell it's barely been addressed or really discussed in any great detail, when it's a game breaking bug\n\nhttps://streamable.com/j9xyb\n\nlong running instances still fall apart.\nin fact, it was worse, as this time there was even de-syncing issues, where people couldn't hear me because i was somewhere else for them, and vice versa. Or I'd hear someone talking to thin air, and they wouldnt hear me when i asked who they were talking to. (And I did check, noone in the room had me blocked)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
